#tr.ts: u gerri nakrim sadārumma sadir 
#tr.en: And the campaign of the enemy continues 
12. u2-ul szu-uh-hu-ut i-na-an-na 
#tr.ts: ul šuḫḫut inanna 
#tr.en: without fear. As of now 
13. s,a-bu-um qa-al-la-tum li-il-li-ik-ma 
#tr.ts: ṣābum qallatum lillikma 
#tr.en: let the light army go, 
14. ge#-er-ri _{lu2}kur2_ li-isz7-[hi]-it,-ma 
#tr.ts: gerri nakrim lišḫiṭma 
#tr.en: and the campaign of the enemy attack, and 
